title: $:/plugins/rimir/minver/changelog
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

|!Version |!Date |!Changes |
|v0.1.8 |2026-05-17 |Test coverage push: 1 new `cg-storage` spec — `stopRecording` is a clean no-op when no recording is active (logs a warning, resolves the promise) rather than crashing. Two `/* istanbul ignore */` annotations on the manual UUID fallback in `storage.js` (`crypto.randomUUID` is available on every supported runtime). Plugin coverage stays at ~36% lines — the bulk of remaining gap is `save-hook.js` and `startup.js` (the wiki-save-lifecycle hooks; Tier D — need a running wiki to exercise) plus localStorage paths in `storage.js`/`cg-storage.js` (browser-only). |
|v0.1.7 |2026-04-27 |Declare `doc-template` as soft-dependent in plugin.info |
|v0.1.6 |2026-03-22 |Change-groups: record sessions of tiddler changes (create/modify/delete) with coalescing, rollback, and cross-plugin API. Auto-snapshots on tiddler creation ("created-*") and deletion ("deleted-*"). Manager revert button for direct snapshot restoration. Refactored shared helpers to storage.js. |
|v0.1.5 |2026-03-15 |Add null guard to th-saving-tiddler hook |
|v0.1.4 |2026-03-15 |Extract inline SVGs to icon tiddlers, replace hardcoded colors with theme palette |
|v0.1.3 |2026-03-15 |Add README.md, fix changelog version prefix |
|v0.1.2 |2026-03-15 |Add regression tests and CI test gate |
|v0.1.1 |2026-03-15 |Fix th-deleting-tiddler hook: return tiddler instead of true to preserve hook chain, add null guard for upstream hooks returning undefined |
|v0.1.0 |2026-03-10 |Initial release: manual/auto snapshots, diff preview, manager, settings, export/import |
